Fish Tank is a drama film directed by Andrea Arnold.

3
00:17:34,285 --> 00:17:40,285
Fifteen-year-old Mia is in a constant state of war with
her family and the world around her.

4
00:23:25,714 --> 00:23:31,714
When she meets her party-girl mother’s charming new boyfriend Connor, she is amazed to find he
returns her attention, and believes he might help her start to make sense of her life.

